    "Nulla looks at you for a moment before responding. You assume he must be waiting for some comment from you about his appearance."

# game/rutas/nulla.rpy:779
translate ingles null_a940b8ae:

    # nulla "...Aquí venía luego de que acabaran las clases."
    nulla "... I would come here after classes."

